### Create a new account — happy path
GRPC {{host}}:{{port}}/bank.v1.BankService/CreateAccount

{
  "account": {
    "id": "alice"
  },
  "initial_balance": 1000
}

### Create a second account
GRPC {{host}}:{{port}}/bank.v1.BankService/CreateAccount

{
  "account": {
    "id": "bob"
  },
  "initial_balance": 0
}

### Duplicate account — expects success: false
GRPC {{host}}:{{port}}/bank.v1.BankService/CreateAccount

{
  "account": {
    "id": "alice"
  },
  "initial_balance": 999
}

